{"synopsis":"Seorang pria yang pernah menjadi petarung terkuat di dunia juara kelas berat dari liga pertarungan terbesar Choi Hyunseok memulai hidup baru sebagai pahlawan di dunia lain setelah kematiannya\nSeorang pahlawan yang memiliki segalanyakekayaan kehormatan wanita cantik\nDengan impian masa depan yang gemilang ia menyeberang ke dunia baru ini hanya untuk disambut oleh monster berotot tinggi dengan kepala banteng Monster itu di pasukan Raja Iblis mencibir Pahlawan Kau seharusnya menjadi pahlawan\nUh kupikir begitu.","alternative_title":"세상에 나쁜 용사는 없다","author":"Ghost Tofu, Hanso","artist":"Ghost Tofu","chapters":[{"chapter_id":"fe78443e-bf95-4699-b902-3e5b34fb2ad9","number":"64","chapter":"64","title":"","date":"2026-06-27","released":"2026-06-27"},{"chapter_id":"05429b6a-a1ea-4a40-a912-a2e11833295c","number":"63","chapter":"63","title":"","date":"2026-04-19","released":"2026-04-19"},{"chapter_id":"ebff8b1b-780a-4d28-83f5-762d723a3ce8","number":"62","chapter":"62","title":"","date":"2026-04-19","released":"2026-04-19"},{"chapter_id":"0ab57c2f-d1e0-433d-bb89-990c0edbcbd8","number":"61","chapter":"61","title":"","date":"2026-04-19","released":"2026-04-19"},{"chapter_id":"6ac03626-a46d-4dea-ab67-e578ff9ee1b5","number":"60","chapter":"60","title":"","date":"2026-04-19","released":"2026-04-19"},{"chapter_id":"f92fccad-87bb-43d1-a827-38f6b348fb72","number":"59","chapter":"59","title":"","date":"2026-04-19","released":"2026-04-19"},{"chapter_id":"ba434485-4517-451c-8bef-bf3c0430c36e","number":"58","chapter":"58","title":"","date":"2026-03-11","released":"2026-03-11"},{"chapter_id":"5c3a3ef5-c948-41bb-80c8-9618922376f5","number":"57","chapter":"57","title":"","date":"2026-03-04","released":"2026-03-04"},{"chapter_id":"2c72bd3d-9dd7-41d0-ba44-4467fcf64d0c","number":"56","chapter":"56","title":"","date":"2026-01-09","released":"2026-01-09"},{"chapter_id":"d5b03e57-a479-41bd-82a6-4bbe9abfb6ba","number":"55","chapter":"55","title":"","date":"2026-01-09","released":"2026-